---
layout: layouts/exploration
title: "Explore - Simply Readable"
description: "Hands-on activities to take the Simply Readable demo further"
scenarioId: simply-readable
eleventyNavigation:
  key: simply-readable-explore
  parent: simply-readable-walkthrough
  title: Explore Further
---

{% set scenarioId = "simply-readable" %}
{% set explorationData = exploration[scenarioId] %}
{% set activities = explorationData.activities %}
{% set personas = explorationData.personas %}
{% set productionGuidance = explorationData.production_guidance %}

<section class="ndx-explore-intro" aria-labelledby="explore-intro-heading">
  <h2 class="govuk-heading-l" id="explore-intro-heading">Explore further</h2>

  <p class="govuk-body-l">
    You've completed the walkthrough. Now try multilingual translation, generate
    Easy Read variants from your own letters, and look inside the Step Functions
    pipeline.
  </p>

  <div class="govuk-inset-text">
    <strong>Safe to explore:</strong> the sandbox is yours. Everything here is designed for experimentation. Nothing you do can break it.
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="deeper-heading">
  <h2 class="govuk-heading-m" id="deeper-heading">Pre-made deep dives</h2>
  <ul class="govuk-list">
    <li><a class="govuk-link" href="/walkthroughs/simply-readable/explore/understand/">Understand how Simply Readable works</a></li>
    <li><a class="govuk-link" href="/walkthroughs/simply-readable/explore/extend/">Extend Simply Readable for your council</a></li>
  </ul>
</section>

{% if personas %}
<section class="ndx-persona-selection" aria-labelledby="persona-heading">
  <h2 class="govuk-heading-m" id="persona-heading">Choose your path</h2>

  <div class="govuk-grid-row">
    {% for key, persona in personas %}
      <div class="govuk-grid-column-one-half">
        <div class="ndx-persona-card" data-persona="{{ persona.id }}">
          <h3 class="govuk-heading-s">{{ persona.title }}</h3>
          <p class="govuk-body-s">{{ persona.description }}</p>
          <p class="govuk-body-s"><strong>Time:</strong> {{ persona.time_estimate }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% include "components/explore-activities.njk" %}
